"Ysgrif News & AI SEO is an independent plugin. It is not affiliated with, "
"endorsed by or sponsored by Google, OpenAI, Anthropic, Microsoft, Perplexity"
" or Apple; their product names are trademarks of their owners."
msgstr ""

